{"3856280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "holoVillage: Our Cozy Days", "steam_appid": 3856280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5059200, 4582350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holoVillage: Our Cozy Days is a game where you can enjoy a slow and carefree rural life together with your favorite VTuber. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cute chibi versions of VTuber talents from hololive Production as you develop your village, explore dungeons, build houses, and enjoy a relaxing slow life together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing slow life with farming, mining, and fishing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the village, you can till the fields, go fishing, craft items with collected materials, open a shop and do business... Enjoy your time freely and leisurely with hololive members in your own way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting dungeon exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the village, enemies appear and dungeons with even more powerful bosses await, offering thrilling adventures for those who seek action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of different weapon types, enhance and customize your equipment through smithing, and combine them with job ability trees to aim for even greater heights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich housing features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your home or shop, you can freely decorate with furniture and goods inspired by hololive to create your ideal interior.<br>At launch, there are over 1,800 types of furniture available!<br>You can stack furniture in multiple layers or place items on walls, allowing for a high degree of freedom in placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your proudly designed room to the server, share it with others, or visit your friends’ rooms!<br>Maybe your oshi might even come visit!?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wide variety of costumes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your character and enjoy dressing up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that reflects yourself, or become your favorite hololive talent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 1,300 costumes and character customization parts in total!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >hololive talents visiting the village</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar hololive talents can be welcomed into your village as residents, allowing you to live together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have them help with farm work, dress them in your favorite outfits, or take photos together...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build precious memories together in a relaxing and peaceful life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until release, be sure to add the game to your wishlist and stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(※1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(※2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: Steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holoVillage: Our Cozy Days is a game where you can enjoy a slow and carefree rural life together with your favorite VTuber. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the cute chibi versions of VTuber talents from hololive Production as you develop your village, explore dungeons, build houses, and enjoy a relaxing slow life together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing slow life with farming, mining, and fishing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the village, you can till the fields, go fishing, craft items with collected materials, open a shop and do business... Enjoy your time freely and leisurely with hololive members in your own way. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting dungeon exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside the village, enemies appear and dungeons with even more powerful bosses await, offering thrilling adventures for those who seek action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the most of different weapon types, enhance and customize your equipment through smithing, and combine them with job ability trees to aim for even greater heights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich housing features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your home or shop, you can freely decorate with furniture and goods inspired by hololive to create your ideal interior.<br>At launch, there are over 1,800 types of furniture available!<br>You can stack furniture in multiple layers or place items on walls, allowing for a high degree of freedom in placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your proudly designed room to the server, share it with others, or visit your friends’ rooms!<br>Maybe your oshi might even come visit!?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wide variety of costumes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your character and enjoy dressing up.</p><p 